"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, cluster_truck.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. BepInEx, the unstripped folder containing required DLLs will be downloaded into Clustertruck's root directory. The mods (AP Mod and a dependency mod) will be downloaded into BepInEx\\plugins.",
